{"id":"6d2e6e91fb32d6c4","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-relrandom-measure.md","title":"固定预言机的随机点集具有全测度","display":"thm-relrandom-measure — 固定预言机的随机点集具有全测度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-relrandom-measure","aliases":["43-thm-relrandom-measure"],"display":"thm-relrandom-measure — 固定预言机的随机点集具有全测度","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-measure]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-relrandom-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-relrandom-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-relrandom-measure — 固定预言机的随机点集具有全测度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 上给出的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\">\\(\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{A}(X)\\})=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{A}(X)\\})=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：固定A后只有可数多个预言机程序，从而只有可数多个A检验。每个失败零集测度0，可数并仍测度0。A不要求可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A$ 见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu$ 是 [[43-df-cylinder]] 在 $\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 上给出的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度，满足 $\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{A}(X)\\})=1.","display":true}],"bytes":1342,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-231","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-relrandom-measure]] — 固定预言机的随机点集具有全测度"},{"id":"f25448b015526e19","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["ab1ef7b1cac112c1","75e7e3b6eeecc95e","8e999d59227f4a28"]}